# Private notes — kept local, never shipped in the public repo.
#
# Anything describing how the apps are built or signed, or cataloguing live
# weaknesses in a running instance, belongs here rather than on GitHub. The
# audience for this repository includes people who would like to find those
# weaknesses before they are fixed.
DESIGN.md
DIAGNOSIS.md
vps-diagnose.sh

# Companion browser apps — kept private; distributed as prebuilt binaries only.
# NEVER commit these, and never override with `git add -f`. See CLAUDE.md.
/app/
/app/**
/android/
/android/**

# Sandbox FUSE artifacts (never real files on your machine)
.fuse_hidden*

# Client brand assets (raw) — private
/img/
/img/**
